    Bug 1283843 - Fix handling of HEAD fallback requests in NntpClient. r=mkmelin


    - Skip headers that no longer exist on the server instead of failing the whole operation.
    - Also add the requested headers to the set of known articles.
    - Fix broken `processHeadLine` function.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D247238

